# Variant mid-opus-high — the fallback for the mid tier when the account's Fable share is used up
# (the default since 2026-09-20 is Fable at `medium`). Opus runs one rung higher than Fable does,
# because in variant b Opus at `medium` was clean only with the Fable advisor beside it.
# Not measured: no benchmark arm ran Opus at `high` on a mid step. Judge off, like the default.
# A variant runs on its own branch (plan/<name>-mid-opus-high); start the plan with it rather than
# switching to it half-way. Benchmark: scripts/plan-runner/benchmark.md
MODEL_MID=opus
EFFORT_MID=high
ADVISOR_MID=
